WEBVTT

01:16.000 --> 01:18.280
[Meet Yourself]

01:19.480 --> 01:24.000
[Episode 30]

01:26.791 --> 01:27.550
Dou.

01:27.551 --> 01:28.591
It's time to leave.

01:29.471 --> 01:31.671
Our taxi will be here soon.

01:33.831 --> 01:34.391
Come on.

01:34.392 --> 01:35.991
You are so beautiful.

01:37.231 --> 01:38.231
My bag.

01:38.711 --> 01:39.711
Yeah, here you are.

01:40.751 --> 01:41.751
Carry it.

01:42.191 --> 01:43.591
Be careful on your trip.

01:46.551 --> 01:47.551
Mi.

01:47.591 --> 01:48.230
Bye.

01:48.231 --> 01:49.070
Work hard.

01:49.071 --> 01:50.391
Don't come back with tears.

01:50.671 --> 01:51.590
Shut up.

01:51.591 --> 01:53.790
Can you say some lucky words?

01:53.791 --> 01:54.910
Hello. Hello.

01:54.911 --> 01:55.710
May you be prosperous.

01:55.711 --> 01:56.431
May you be prosperous.

01:56.431 --> 01:57.150
Look at you two.

01:57.151 --> 01:58.190
Come on. Time to go.

01:58.191 --> 01:59.191
Well, Dou.

01:59.231 --> 01:59.911
You have to transfer.

01:59.912 --> 02:01.230
Prepare something for you.

02:01.231 --> 02:02.510
She can buy these everywhere.

02:02.511 --> 02:03.656
Don't bother her.

02:03.657 --> 02:05.470
I prepared these for her.

02:05.471 --> 02:06.870
Come on, time to go.

02:06.871 --> 02:07.871
Well.

02:10.551 --> 02:14.070
Don't forget to call
me when you arrive.

02:14.071 --> 02:15.191
Yeah, I know.

02:15.711 --> 02:17.990
If you're busy,
just send me messages.

02:17.991 --> 02:18.991
Okay.

02:20.471 --> 02:21.471
Be careful.

02:22.751 --> 02:23.470
Bye.

02:23.471 --> 02:24.471
Goodbye.

03:04.591 --> 03:05.191
Okay, smile.

03:05.191 --> 03:05.991
Excuse me, a minute.

03:05.992 --> 03:07.831
1 2 3.

03:09.391 --> 03:10.590
Xin, be careful.

03:10.591 --> 03:12.030
That table is waiting too long.

03:12.031 --> 03:12.831
You wash this. I'll do it.

03:12.831 --> 03:13.831
Okay.

03:14.631 --> 03:15.151
Mom.

03:15.152 --> 03:18.630
Can you call uncle,
and ask him when he will arrive?

03:18.631 --> 03:20.870
I have to tell you,
now mom is so busy.

03:20.871 --> 03:21.511
Don't worry.

03:21.512 --> 03:22.470
Have a seat over there.

03:22.471 --> 03:23.471
Is it okay?

03:23.511 --> 03:24.511
But...

03:25.431 --> 03:27.190
Please be more patient.

03:27.191 --> 03:28.271
Now I call and ask.

03:30.751 --> 03:31.991
Why are so many people?

03:33.631 --> 03:35.351
The bus of the tour group is broken.

03:35.671 --> 03:37.510
Uncle, let's go.

03:37.511 --> 03:38.311
Wait a moment.

03:38.312 --> 03:40.231
The lion dance will start at twelve.

03:40.631 --> 03:41.191
Where's Nana?

03:41.191 --> 03:41.790
She has a day off.

03:41.791 --> 03:42.870
What? It's so busy today.

03:42.871 --> 03:44.310
Why don't call her and ask for her support?

03:44.311 --> 03:44.951
She's not here.

03:44.952 --> 03:46.911
She's going to the airport
to meet her Mr. Right.

03:47.431 --> 03:48.671
She has a boyfriend?

03:48.951 --> 03:49.870
I don't know.

03:49.871 --> 03:51.710
Go to watch the lion dance with Hulu.

03:51.711 --> 03:52.471
She's waiting for you.

03:52.472 --> 03:53.510
Come on, go.

03:53.511 --> 03:55.550
Uncle, let's go.

03:55.551 --> 03:56.311
Why?

03:56.312 --> 03:58.550
Tuotuo must be there.

03:58.551 --> 04:00.190
Uncle, come on.

04:00.191 --> 04:00.991
Okay, bye.

04:00.992 --> 04:01.870
Bye.

04:01.871 --> 04:02.910
Be good, girl.

04:02.911 --> 04:03.670
Let's go.

04:03.671 --> 04:05.551
Go to see the lion dance.

04:21.831 --> 04:22.991
Hello, Hongdou.

04:23.511 --> 04:24.670
Okay, I'm at the entrance now.

04:24.671 --> 04:25.831
Just come out.

04:28.831 --> 04:30.111
I see you.

04:30.511 --> 04:31.591
Hongdou.

04:32.511 --> 04:33.551
Hongdou.

04:43.191 --> 04:44.271
Granny.

04:47.271 --> 04:48.831
Hongdou.

04:49.671 --> 04:51.471
When did you come back?

04:51.871 --> 04:54.510
Why didn't Yao tell me?

04:54.511 --> 04:56.230
I haven't told him.

04:56.231 --> 04:57.791
I'll talk with you later, granny.

04:58.871 --> 04:59.790
You're back.

04:59.791 --> 05:00.951
It's good.

05:01.831 --> 05:03.430
What do you want for lunch?

05:03.431 --> 05:06.030
I'll call Yao to buy it for you.

05:06.031 --> 05:07.031
No, no.

05:07.191 --> 05:09.031
Now I'm going to meet him.

05:10.271 --> 05:11.271
Yeah, great.

05:11.671 --> 05:13.550
A new store opened,

05:13.551 --> 05:16.671
he promised to watch the lion dance with Hulu.

05:16.991 --> 05:17.790
I know.

05:17.791 --> 05:18.951
See you at home.

05:19.951 --> 05:20.951
Bye.

05:21.271 --> 05:22.391
Take care.

05:25.431 --> 05:26.431
Great.

05:37.791 --> 05:40.391
Excellent.

05:41.431 --> 05:43.471
Great.

05:50.791 --> 05:54.471
Wow.

05:59.791 --> 06:01.151
Uncle, uncle.

06:01.431 --> 06:02.671
There.

06:03.031 --> 06:04.151
What?

06:07.631 --> 06:09.831
I saw Sister Hongdou.

06:10.911 --> 06:12.471
Maybe they just look similar.

06:13.031 --> 06:13.950
Do you want to watch the lion dance?

06:13.951 --> 06:15.110
I'll put you down if you don't watch it.

06:15.111 --> 06:16.830
My neck hurts.

06:16.831 --> 06:18.550
No. I want to watch more.

06:18.551 --> 06:21.911
Great.

06:22.391 --> 06:22.991
You're so little.

06:22.992 --> 06:24.390
How can you run into the crowd?

06:24.391 --> 06:26.591
If you fall,
it's easy to be trampled by others.

06:27.071 --> 06:28.830
But I can't see it.

06:28.831 --> 06:30.510
You can't push through the crowd.

06:30.511 --> 06:31.151
Sister Hongdou.

06:31.152 --> 06:32.630
You just left, right?

06:32.631 --> 06:34.071
I'm back.

06:34.391 --> 06:35.871
Come on, I tell you.

06:39.711 --> 06:40.391
Be careful.

06:40.391 --> 06:41.391
Don't get hurt.

06:52.711 --> 06:54.311
Great.

06:55.911 --> 06:57.030
Tuotuo, what's wrong?

06:57.031 --> 06:59.870
Sister Nana went to the
guesthouse with someone.

06:59.871 --> 07:01.150
She asked you to go back.

07:01.151 --> 07:03.030
Nana? Who is it?

07:03.031 --> 07:04.310
Why did she ask you to tell me?

07:04.311 --> 07:06.950
Sister Nana went to the
guesthouse with someone.

07:06.951 --> 07:08.351
She asked you to go back.

07:09.151 --> 07:09.990
Okay.

07:09.991 --> 07:12.670
Sister Nana went to the
guesthouse with someone.

07:12.671 --> 07:13.950
She asked you to go back.

07:13.951 --> 07:15.031
Okay, I know.

07:15.671 --> 07:18.271
Great.

07:21.171 --> 07:22.550
[Dali Leather Goods Store]

07:22.551 --> 07:24.551
Great.

07:32.871 --> 07:33.871
Hello.

07:33.991 --> 07:34.991
I'm Xie...

07:37.271 --> 07:38.390
Hello.

07:38.391 --> 07:39.471
I'm Xu Hongdou.

07:47.231 --> 07:48.831
What? What's your reaction?

07:49.191 --> 07:50.191
Shocked?

07:54.111 --> 07:54.711
Xie Zhiyao.

07:54.711 --> 07:55.791
Come on.

07:56.111 --> 07:58.391
Are you so excited to cry?

08:01.871 --> 08:03.551
Why did you come back suddenly?

08:04.791 --> 08:06.231
It's not all of sudden.

08:06.751 --> 08:08.271
I've considered it for a long time.

08:09.071 --> 08:10.511
You're on purpose.

08:11.271 --> 08:12.390
Yeah, I am.

08:12.391 --> 08:13.791
I'd like to see your reaction.

08:14.391 --> 08:16.351
Why do you see me via your phone screen?

08:16.631 --> 08:18.271
Cause I'm recording.

08:19.271 --> 08:21.271
It's you who are afraid of crying.

08:26.511 --> 08:27.911
How can you be so confident?

08:28.631 --> 08:30.031
Look at you.

08:36.671 --> 08:37.671
I...

08:37.871 --> 08:39.151
I didn't wash my hair yesterday.

08:39.911 --> 08:40.991
Yeah, I can see that.

08:41.591 --> 08:43.351
Usually, I wash my hair every day.

08:44.271 --> 08:45.430
Xie Zhiyao.

08:45.431 --> 08:47.271
It's not the first day I know you.

08:51.311 --> 08:52.311
Why do you come here?

08:53.631 --> 08:54.631
I...

08:56.031 --> 08:57.391
It's not obvious?

08:57.671 --> 08:58.911
I'm here to see the guesthouse.

09:03.071 --> 09:06.031
It's you who persuaded me,
to have a career here.

09:07.791 --> 09:09.110
But you said you wouldn't consider it

09:09.111 --> 09:10.831
only after the opening of the bookstore.

09:12.031 --> 09:13.830
But now it's in a good bargain.

09:13.831 --> 09:15.551
Perfect time to invest.

09:15.991 --> 09:18.150
The opening of Shaohua Bookstore

09:18.151 --> 09:20.070
will bring a lot of benefits.

09:20.071 --> 09:21.751
Then the price will go up.

09:22.711 --> 09:25.590
Now I've got the
confidential information,

09:25.591 --> 09:28.070
if now isn't the perfect time,
when will it be?

09:28.071 --> 09:29.711
Wait till the price is up?

09:33.831 --> 09:35.471
You're going to run a guesthouse here?

09:36.151 --> 09:37.911
I didn't say it clearly?

09:39.991 --> 09:41.750
A startup is not easy.

09:41.751 --> 09:43.150
Thanks.

09:43.151 --> 09:44.950
I've found my business partner.

09:44.951 --> 09:45.710
Who is it?

09:45.711 --> 09:46.711
A secret for now.

09:47.271 --> 09:48.471
Don't welcome me?

09:51.631 --> 09:53.151
Are you sure?

09:53.911 --> 09:54.750
Okay, fine.

09:54.751 --> 09:56.110
No, no.

09:56.111 --> 09:57.551
Of course, I welcome you.

09:57.831 --> 09:59.791
I'm just a little bit

10:01.311 --> 10:02.311
astonished.

10:05.291 --> 10:07.971
♫ Keep staring at my phone ♫

10:10.451 --> 10:14.211
♫ Waiting for your text ♫

10:15.431 --> 10:16.310
Where is your luggage?

10:16.311 --> 10:17.390
♫ I'd say I had a good chance ♫

10:17.391 --> 10:18.991
Nana put it in the yard.

10:21.671 --> 10:23.630
Tell Huang Xinxin.

10:23.631 --> 10:25.671
Don't need to show this guesthouse to others.

10:26.031 --> 10:28.791
And I will pay the rent
just like you told me before.

10:30.551 --> 10:31.551
Is it okay?

10:32.431 --> 10:33.431
Sure.

10:33.511 --> 10:33.871
Well.

10:33.872 --> 10:35.951
I'll go to the Committee office,
and tell her.

10:36.231 --> 10:37.070
Well.

10:37.071 --> 10:38.191
You go back first.

10:41.511 --> 10:42.831
I'll settle it for tonight.

10:43.671 --> 10:44.791
Settle what?

10:45.191 --> 10:46.191
Banquet.

10:46.811 --> 10:50.731
♫ The beating of my heart for you ♫

10:51.891 --> 10:55.491
♫ Off the ground ♫

10:55.891 --> 11:00.691
♫ You lift me so high my love ♫

11:02.331 --> 11:04.730
♫ Hardly breathing ♫

11:04.731 --> 11:10.124
♫ Validation feels so near ♫

11:14.111 --> 11:15.191
Welcome back.

11:27.671 --> 11:28.671
See you tonight.

11:30.271 --> 11:34.130
♫ They say this thing I'm feeling
will be gone in a minute ♫

11:34.131 --> 11:38.371
♫ But it's different my baby ♫

11:39.651 --> 11:43.931
♫ Let me hold your hand baby ♫

11:44.531 --> 11:48.171
♫ Nothing will change my babe ♫

11:50.531 --> 11:56.431
♫ So I need to confirm
if you like me like I wanted you ♫

11:57.151 --> 12:01.990
♫ You need to validate ♫

12:01.991 --> 12:05.891
♫ Validate my love for you ♫

12:37.391 --> 12:39.151
Jiahui.

12:40.071 --> 12:42.071
I'm back, Jiahui.

12:51.991 --> 12:53.791
Didn't find Mr. Xie?

12:54.431 --> 12:56.791
A new store is opening,
he went to help.

12:57.831 --> 12:59.470
Your luggage is in your room.

12:59.471 --> 13:01.870
I haven't told Xiaochun
you'll continue to rent.

13:01.871 --> 13:04.191
Remember to call
her and tell her.

13:04.671 --> 13:05.671
Yeah.

13:05.791 --> 13:06.831
What do you want?

13:07.591 --> 13:08.591
Coffee.

13:08.711 --> 13:09.711
Okay.

13:17.791 --> 13:19.231
I'm back.

13:59.671 --> 14:01.110
Is it clean?

14:01.111 --> 14:02.750
I swept the room twice.

14:02.751 --> 14:03.391
Here you are.

14:03.391 --> 14:04.391
Thanks.

14:07.671 --> 14:09.831
You just brought one suitcase?

14:10.071 --> 14:11.751
My mom will send me later.

14:12.951 --> 14:15.070
Is there anything else I can help?

14:15.071 --> 14:16.071
No, thanks.

14:19.471 --> 14:20.630
I didn't take anything this time.

14:20.631 --> 14:21.510
Make the bed.

14:21.511 --> 14:22.871
It's okay to sleep here.

14:26.391 --> 14:27.391
Well.

14:27.911 --> 14:30.231
Can our guesthouse earn a lot?

14:35.111 --> 14:36.271
Lower your expectations.

14:36.591 --> 14:37.630
Survive first.

14:37.631 --> 14:38.751
Take your time.

14:39.711 --> 14:40.711
Take my time.

14:43.671 --> 14:45.191
It's not a flower road.
(Flower Road: Good things to happen.)

14:45.791 --> 14:48.030
Once it opens,
it's a road to the guest rooms,

14:48.031 --> 14:49.471
to the kitchen,

14:49.711 --> 14:51.630
and to the blocked drains.

14:51.631 --> 14:52.831
Be prepared.

14:54.551 --> 14:55.951
I'm waiting for it.

14:56.751 --> 14:57.751
Nana.

14:58.111 --> 14:59.590
I didn't expect that we'd be business partners,

14:59.591 --> 15:00.911
and run a guesthouse.

15:01.151 --> 15:02.150
And I can't imagine that

15:02.151 --> 15:03.911
you are coming back to open a guesthouse.

15:05.151 --> 15:08.311
A guesthouse, with me,

15:08.791 --> 15:10.550
are you serious?

15:10.551 --> 15:11.390
Yes.

15:11.391 --> 15:12.791
You have money, right?

15:14.431 --> 15:15.471
Yeah.

15:16.751 --> 15:18.151
Do you want to join?

15:18.557 --> 15:20.317
Actually, I can find another partner.

15:20.791 --> 15:23.511
But I considered it,
you're the perfect one.

15:23.831 --> 15:25.670
The cafe in the guesthouse lobby,
you can handle it.

15:25.671 --> 15:26.751
I believe in you.

15:31.111 --> 15:34.351
But is it kind of like
poaching an employee from Mr. Xie?

15:34.791 --> 15:36.991
It's every man for himself.

15:37.231 --> 15:38.430
Working for others won't be better

15:38.431 --> 15:39.831
than working for yourself.

15:41.111 --> 15:42.111
Xu Hongdou.

15:42.631 --> 15:46.671
I didn't know who you were before.

15:47.791 --> 15:50.071
I like it.

15:51.111 --> 15:53.430
My mom said it was good
to invest in this project.

15:53.431 --> 15:55.390
My dad said it was
not too much to invest,

15:55.391 --> 15:57.071
just do it if I like.

15:57.871 --> 15:59.030
Hope we can work well.

15:59.031 --> 16:00.191
Hope we can work well.

16:06.871 --> 16:08.231
Come on. Dish up.

16:09.271 --> 16:10.390
Shall I leave you some?

16:10.391 --> 16:11.510
No need.

16:11.511 --> 16:12.870
I have other dishes.

16:12.871 --> 16:13.871
Okay.

16:19.191 --> 16:20.110
Won't you join us?

16:20.111 --> 16:21.230
No.

16:21.231 --> 16:23.150
A large group of people are so noisy.

16:23.151 --> 16:24.390
Go to join them now.

16:24.391 --> 16:25.110
Okay, fine.

16:25.111 --> 16:25.910
Goodbye.

16:25.911 --> 16:26.911
Bye.

16:30.271 --> 16:31.471
This way, this way.

16:31.751 --> 16:34.271
Don't give orders to me,
I have my own style.

16:36.911 --> 16:37.671
Come on, there.

16:37.672 --> 16:38.830
This was what Bai told me last time

16:38.831 --> 16:40.430
when she did a massage for me.

16:40.431 --> 16:43.351
For shoulders,
there are two important points.

16:44.471 --> 16:46.111
Guess how old Bai is?

16:46.711 --> 16:49.270
In her thirties or forties?

16:49.271 --> 16:50.751
In her twenties.

16:51.591 --> 16:54.511
Bai's daughter is in high school now.

16:55.431 --> 16:56.190
Really?

16:56.191 --> 16:57.310
She looks so young.

16:57.311 --> 16:57.950
Hongdou.

16:57.951 --> 16:59.310
Xinxin is not back?

16:59.311 --> 17:00.430
She'll be back soon.

17:00.431 --> 17:01.231
Thanks, Hongdou.

17:01.231 --> 17:01.711
You're welcome.

17:01.712 --> 17:02.590
The wine is ready.

17:02.591 --> 17:03.871
Come on.

17:04.871 --> 17:05.671
You're pretty.

17:05.672 --> 17:06.831
You're prettier.

17:07.711 --> 17:08.990
Hongdou, miss you.

17:08.991 --> 17:09.910
You're back finally.

17:09.911 --> 17:10.431
Welcome.

17:10.432 --> 17:11.831
Miss you a lot.

17:12.191 --> 17:14.351
Welcome back.

17:15.631 --> 17:16.191
A little bit.

17:16.192 --> 17:18.750
Okay, thanks, A little bit.

17:18.751 --> 17:19.951
Thanks.

17:20.671 --> 17:21.671
Good boy.

17:24.951 --> 17:26.030
Hu.

17:26.031 --> 17:26.311
Thanks.

17:26.312 --> 17:27.190
Come on, here.

17:27.191 --> 17:27.950
Hu.

17:27.951 --> 17:29.150
Stop eating.

17:29.151 --> 17:31.110
Let the elderly eat first.

17:31.111 --> 17:32.751
How can we eat first?

17:33.471 --> 17:35.190
Tuotuo is a good boy.

17:35.191 --> 17:36.150
I'm also a good boy.

17:36.151 --> 17:37.551
I just tried it.

17:45.311 --> 17:46.431
Here, everybody.

17:46.871 --> 17:48.230
Stir-fried steak with mint.

17:48.231 --> 17:49.310
It's the last one?

17:49.311 --> 17:49.871
Yes.

17:49.872 --> 17:50.710
Put it in front of Chuchu.

17:50.711 --> 17:51.431
She loves steak.

17:51.431 --> 17:52.231
Okay, no problem.

17:52.232 --> 17:53.870
Thanks, it's okay to put it there.

17:53.871 --> 17:54.510
Sit down.

17:54.511 --> 17:55.470
Yao.

17:55.471 --> 17:56.990
Why is your granny not here?

17:56.991 --> 17:59.990
I invited her,
but she said it was too noisy here.

17:59.991 --> 18:01.470
But she told me,
when the banquet ends,

18:01.471 --> 18:02.551
she'll play mahjong.

18:03.111 --> 18:04.231
Okay, great.

18:05.231 --> 18:09.670
Hongdou came back,
Yao prepared a lavish banquet dinner.

18:09.671 --> 18:11.591
It seems like a wedding here.

18:13.391 --> 18:14.911
Yeah, it is.

18:15.311 --> 18:16.070
Yao.

18:16.071 --> 18:18.071
How about holding
an engagement ceremony right now?

18:19.511 --> 18:21.310
Don't talk nonsense.

18:21.311 --> 18:21.911
Tomorrow,

18:21.912 --> 18:23.791
the gossip will spread
throughout the whole village.

18:24.391 --> 18:27.430
Today why we're here is to
welcome Ms. Xu Hongdou.

18:27.431 --> 18:29.510
And really appreciate that

18:29.511 --> 18:32.110
she joins the career
of our village's tourism development.

18:32.111 --> 18:32.711
Great.

18:32.711 --> 18:33.311
Welcome, Hongdou.

18:33.311 --> 18:34.351
Thanks, thanks.

18:35.271 --> 18:36.590
Thank you all.

18:36.591 --> 18:39.230
And thanks for all your help in advance.

18:39.231 --> 18:42.511
Please kindly forgive me for
any trouble I may bring to you.

18:43.431 --> 18:43.711
Hongdou.

18:43.712 --> 18:45.151
Don't be so modest.

18:45.471 --> 18:47.630
Just bother Yao as much as you want.

18:47.631 --> 18:49.270
Let him help you.

18:49.271 --> 18:50.870
He is so pleased to help you, right?

18:50.871 --> 18:52.270
Auntie Feng, making fun of me again.

18:52.271 --> 18:53.430
Come on.

18:53.431 --> 18:57.710
Guanjun told me that Yao
said when the bookstore opens,

18:57.711 --> 18:59.751
The village committee will help him
to find a girlfriend.

19:00.031 --> 19:02.030
Don't bother Village Committee.

19:02.031 --> 19:03.311
Work hard by yourself.

19:04.431 --> 19:05.750
Yang Guanjun is always making fun of me.

19:05.751 --> 19:07.111
When did I say that?

19:07.911 --> 19:09.870
Really? If he does well,
they'll get him a girlfriend?

19:09.871 --> 19:12.270
When my guesthouse opens,
can they find me a boyfriend?

19:12.271 --> 19:15.471
Okay, fine, How about Xiaxia?

19:16.911 --> 19:19.310
She is the boss,
will she like Xiaxia?

19:19.311 --> 19:20.470
Yes, it's okay.

19:20.471 --> 19:22.670
When my guesthouse opens,
I'll go to get him.

19:22.671 --> 19:23.671
Okay.

19:24.071 --> 19:27.071
Listen, if you like,
come to get whatever you want.

19:27.591 --> 19:28.590
Xiaxia.

19:28.591 --> 19:29.991
Why are you blushing?

19:30.471 --> 19:31.071
Stop it.

19:31.072 --> 19:31.910
Xiaxia.

19:31.911 --> 19:34.750
If you are so shy,
how can you find a girlfriend?

19:34.751 --> 19:35.751
Right?

19:36.271 --> 19:37.351
Come on, Xiaxia, try this.

19:38.151 --> 19:38.910
Chuchu.

19:38.911 --> 19:40.310
How old are you?

19:40.311 --> 19:41.711
I'm 24 years old.

19:42.471 --> 19:43.950
It's a good match.

19:43.951 --> 19:45.551
How about Xiaxia?

19:45.951 --> 19:47.831
Xiaxia is a good boy.

19:48.631 --> 19:49.631
Xiaxia.

19:49.751 --> 19:51.271
Why are you blushing again?

19:51.911 --> 19:53.110
Stop it.

19:53.111 --> 19:54.511
What's wrong with you?

19:56.591 --> 19:57.710
Well, come on.

19:57.711 --> 19:59.190
I'd like to propose a toast.

19:59.191 --> 20:00.590
Welcome, Xu Hongdou.

20:00.591 --> 20:02.190
Welcome.

20:02.191 --> 20:03.550
Welcome, Xu Hongdou.

20:03.551 --> 20:05.990
Sister Hongdou. Sister Hongdou.

20:05.991 --> 20:07.510
Sister Hongdou. Sister Hongdou.

20:07.511 --> 20:08.511
Thanks.

20:11.431 --> 20:12.031
Uncle Yao.

20:12.032 --> 20:13.510
Can I start eating now?

20:13.511 --> 20:14.871
Greedy boy.

20:15.111 --> 20:15.950
Yeah, enjoy yourself.

20:15.951 --> 20:16.631
It's a family dinner.

20:16.631 --> 20:17.390
Help yourself.

20:17.391 --> 20:17.911
Come on.

20:17.911 --> 20:18.630
Okay.

20:18.631 --> 20:19.631
Help yourself.

20:20.431 --> 20:21.791
Enjoy yourselves.

21:05.071 --> 21:06.871
Pork stew.

21:07.871 --> 21:10.711
Tonight, pork stew for dinner.

21:37.271 --> 21:38.271
Hello.

21:38.951 --> 21:39.951
Mom.

21:39.991 --> 21:41.231
I just took a shower.

21:42.231 --> 21:43.910
What did you have for dinner?

21:43.911 --> 21:45.710
It was a banquet dinner.

21:45.711 --> 21:47.110
Aunties were here.

21:47.111 --> 21:48.030
And we filmed a video.

21:48.031 --> 21:49.191
I'll send you later.

21:49.591 --> 21:50.070
Alright.

21:50.071 --> 21:51.831
Don't forget to send me.

21:52.671 --> 21:53.647
Right.

21:53.671 --> 21:56.911
Your bag, at the bottom of it,
just have a look.

21:58.071 --> 21:59.671
What did you put in here?

22:02.911 --> 22:03.910
At the bottom.

22:03.911 --> 22:05.471
Do you see that?

22:05.984 --> 22:07.784
Your CCB card.

22:09.311 --> 22:11.030
I... if I give it to
you face to face,

22:11.031 --> 22:13.351
you'll give it back secretly.

22:13.991 --> 22:17.030
In this card,
there's 200 thousand yuan you gave me before,

22:17.031 --> 22:18.270
and plus that, I asked your dad

22:18.271 --> 22:19.951
to save 100 thousand more in this account.

22:20.671 --> 22:23.830
It was supposed to buy
an apartment for you,

22:23.831 --> 22:25.991
or give you when you are married.

22:26.991 --> 22:28.991
Mom, we've talked about this before.

22:29.631 --> 22:31.030
My sister bought a house for you.

22:31.031 --> 22:32.831
I'd pay for interior design and decoration.

22:33.191 --> 22:35.871
And 200 thousand for decoration is not enough.

22:36.551 --> 22:37.670
I have money.

22:37.671 --> 22:39.630
Yeah, I know.

22:39.631 --> 22:41.270
But now you have your own startup.

22:41.271 --> 22:42.550
You need money, right?

22:42.551 --> 22:44.871
When you need money,
you have that card.

22:45.471 --> 22:47.271
Don't send it back to me.

22:47.511 --> 22:48.711
Take it.

22:49.031 --> 22:50.950
If you take it,
then I won't be worried about you.

22:50.951 --> 22:51.951
Is it okay?

22:55.831 --> 22:56.831
Yeah, thanks.

22:57.391 --> 22:59.271
This 300 thousand,

22:59.871 --> 23:01.471
is like your investment in my guesthouse.

23:01.751 --> 23:04.310
When it starts to get profit,
you can get a bonus.

23:04.311 --> 23:05.270
Okay, great.

23:05.271 --> 23:06.391
Sounds great.

23:07.031 --> 23:07.950
Well.

23:07.951 --> 23:10.311
And the code, you knew it.

23:10.551 --> 23:11.310
Mom.

23:11.311 --> 23:13.551
Don't use this code for all cards.

23:13.791 --> 23:14.910
300400.

23:14.911 --> 23:16.071
Change one.

23:16.991 --> 23:17.751
I'd better not.

23:17.752 --> 23:20.111
My bad memory can't support me
to remember a new code.

23:21.391 --> 23:22.070
Okay.

23:22.071 --> 23:23.351
Don't stay up too late.

23:24.831 --> 23:25.510
Well.

23:25.511 --> 23:27.271
Don't forget to send me the video.

23:29.111 --> 23:29.710
Yeah.

23:29.711 --> 23:30.911
Goodbye.

24:02.951 --> 24:03.991
What's wrong?

24:04.271 --> 24:05.951
Come to have rice noodles tomorrow?

24:07.071 --> 24:08.071
No.

24:08.671 --> 24:09.831
What's wrong?

24:10.711 --> 24:11.711
Are you crying?

24:12.551 --> 24:13.551
No.

24:14.191 --> 24:15.430
Why?

24:15.431 --> 24:16.431
What's wrong?

24:18.271 --> 24:20.831
Looking at my cash card,
I'm thinking.

24:22.551 --> 24:23.910
You lost your money?

24:23.911 --> 24:25.191
Someone stole it?

24:25.631 --> 24:28.591
Or your mom uses it to buy a
house for your younger brother.

24:29.031 --> 24:30.471
For your younger brother.

24:32.191 --> 24:33.911
I'm just kidding.

24:36.911 --> 24:38.390
I gave my mom money for interior design,

24:38.391 --> 24:39.390
but she didn't use it,

24:39.391 --> 24:41.791
saved 100 thousand more, and gave it back to me.

24:42.391 --> 24:42.951
Well.

24:42.952 --> 24:44.911
How can I return my parents' love?

24:45.591 --> 24:47.271
I am not a good daughter.

24:48.671 --> 24:49.510
And I complained that

24:49.511 --> 24:51.351
they mopped the floor using shower water.

24:52.431 --> 24:52.911
Hey man.

24:52.912 --> 24:54.831
Can you show your sympathy?

24:55.751 --> 24:56.471
Sorry.

24:56.471 --> 24:57.551
I'm not laughing.

24:59.551 --> 25:01.750
The night is kind of
like the hell of emotions.

25:01.751 --> 25:03.351
Don't get stuck in it.

25:04.111 --> 25:06.711
Or I help to change your mood?

25:08.151 --> 25:09.191
How?

25:10.031 --> 25:11.870
How about some cheesy pick up lines?

25:11.871 --> 25:12.830
Well.

25:12.831 --> 25:15.151
When you hear it,
you just feel disgusting.

25:17.511 --> 25:18.791
You can have a try.

25:20.031 --> 25:21.031
Xu Hongdou.

25:22.191 --> 25:24.391
Why don't you look out while walking?

25:24.711 --> 25:26.871
Or you won't have had a crush on me.

25:31.551 --> 25:32.551
And?

25:34.511 --> 25:36.671
Can I purchase land from you?

25:38.031 --> 25:39.031
Why?

25:39.311 --> 25:41.191
So I can land on your heart.

25:45.071 --> 25:46.071
Anymore?

25:46.871 --> 25:47.911
Of course.

25:48.551 --> 25:50.231
Can you take me to the cardiology hospital?

25:51.071 --> 25:52.391
What's wrong?

25:52.791 --> 25:53.911
My heart skips a beat.

25:57.191 --> 25:58.191
Are you happy now?

26:00.551 --> 26:01.551
Not bad.

26:01.711 --> 26:03.151
That's great.

26:04.751 --> 26:05.910
Tomorrow is another day.

26:05.911 --> 26:07.271
You will feel better.

26:07.511 --> 26:09.351
So, go to sleep now.

26:10.231 --> 26:11.390
Wait. Wait a second.

26:11.391 --> 26:12.310
What about this?

26:12.311 --> 26:13.990
I'll make rice noodles at home tomorrow.

26:13.991 --> 26:14.711
Wake up naturally.

26:14.712 --> 26:15.831
Come to have breakfast.

26:16.991 --> 26:18.071
No, I'm not going.

26:18.551 --> 26:19.551
Why?

26:19.831 --> 26:21.470
I'm afraid they'll laugh at me.

26:21.471 --> 26:22.751
Who will make fun of you?

26:25.191 --> 26:25.910
Fine.

26:25.911 --> 26:26.710
Good night.

26:26.711 --> 26:27.430
I'm going to bed.

26:27.431 --> 26:27.671
What?

26:27.671 --> 26:28.671
Wait. Wait a second.

26:29.471 --> 26:30.791
I'll take it to your place.

26:31.831 --> 26:32.710
Sounds good.

26:32.711 --> 26:33.711
See you.

26:35.231 --> 26:38.430
♫ Sometimes I find I fall in love ♫

26:38.431 --> 26:39.511
Sounds good?

26:40.071 --> 26:41.150
She put on airs.

26:41.151 --> 26:48.431
♫ My wish may come true ♫

26:54.191 --> 26:55.311
What sounds good?

27:01.031 --> 27:05.311
♫ The wind brings blossoms in happiness ♫

27:06.031 --> 27:08.030
♫ Sunset wakes up the night of stars ♫

27:08.031 --> 27:13.030
♫ A beautiful time ♫

27:13.031 --> 27:15.310
[Youfeng Yard]

27:15.311 --> 27:18.231
Before I came here I made a
plan for guesthouse development.

27:18.631 --> 27:21.430
It will follow the initiatives of our village,

27:21.431 --> 27:23.870
and invest in the elimination
of pollutant discharging.

27:23.871 --> 27:24.191
Wait.

27:24.192 --> 27:25.070
So we can...

27:25.071 --> 27:26.311
I will read it later.

27:26.871 --> 27:28.151
I have one question.

27:28.591 --> 27:29.591
I'm listening.

27:30.271 --> 27:32.871
How do you cooperate exactly?

27:34.631 --> 27:37.230
I'm in charge of guesthouse
operation and management.

27:37.231 --> 27:39.190
As a manager, my shareholding is 20% of all.

27:39.191 --> 27:41.831
Nana and I share the rest of
the stock equally as investors.

27:42.191 --> 27:44.310
When it opens,
I also can work at the cafe

27:44.311 --> 27:46.671
and get one more payment as an employee.

27:49.871 --> 27:53.590
My dad once told me
it's a curse for two friends

27:53.591 --> 27:56.151
to start up a business together.

27:56.511 --> 27:58.910
Once you have a conflict,
you can't run the business,

27:58.911 --> 28:00.711
and can't be friends anymore.

28:01.271 --> 28:02.431
It won't happen to us.

28:02.791 --> 28:04.030
If your business is not optimistic,

28:04.031 --> 28:06.991
something wrong with the funding,
I'll sell her watch.

28:09.191 --> 28:10.870
Huang is worried you do it for an impulse.

28:10.871 --> 28:12.471
Or you are too optimistic.

28:12.871 --> 28:14.310
No, we aren't.

28:14.311 --> 28:16.390
It's not a flower road to run it.

28:16.391 --> 28:18.790
It's a road to guest rooms,
to the kitchen,

28:18.791 --> 28:20.751
or to blocked drains.

28:21.591 --> 28:22.231
I know it.

28:22.232 --> 28:24.470
Hongdou has told me everything about it.

28:24.471 --> 28:26.911
And I am psychologically ready.

28:33.471 --> 28:35.430
No matter how much
you have to prepare psychologically.

28:35.431 --> 28:38.030
When you face reality,
you will never be perfectly ready.

28:38.031 --> 28:39.670
There're so many challenges.

28:39.671 --> 28:41.390
If it doesn't go well,

28:41.391 --> 28:44.871
it will be shut down someday, sooner or later.

28:46.071 --> 28:47.070
How long?

28:47.071 --> 28:48.991
Some can't survive after two years.

28:51.391 --> 28:53.590
To be honest,
I've consulted with

28:53.591 --> 28:56.151
my friend, an owner of a guesthouse.

28:56.471 --> 28:58.950
My budget is enough for now.

28:58.951 --> 29:00.471
She also did the calculation for me.

29:00.711 --> 29:03.230
Listen,
I've paid the rent for five years.

29:03.231 --> 29:05.471
And, the rent is nice.

29:06.231 --> 29:08.150
And it's estimated the rent now

29:08.151 --> 29:11.550
is less the 30 percent of annual revenues.

29:11.551 --> 29:13.670
So we won't feel pressured.

29:13.671 --> 29:15.430
But of course sometimes,

29:15.431 --> 29:17.590
there will be accidents that we can't foresee

29:17.591 --> 29:19.311
when we truly run the business.

29:20.631 --> 29:22.191
But we should start it first.

29:22.471 --> 29:25.231
If we're overcautious,
we can do nothing at all.

29:25.471 --> 29:26.791
Like we have to solve the problem

29:27.511 --> 29:28.871
only when it comes to us.

29:30.111 --> 29:31.151
I'm thinking the same.

29:37.271 --> 29:38.950
Huang, said it just in case.

29:38.951 --> 29:41.791
You should be calm and serious.

29:42.031 --> 29:43.391
It's you who are worried.

29:47.191 --> 29:48.230
I know.

29:48.231 --> 29:51.071
No matter what is coming to us,
President Xie,

29:51.431 --> 29:54.430
and Xinxin,
will support us as you can.

29:54.431 --> 29:57.191
You won't let me face it alone,
right?

30:00.631 --> 30:03.231
Don't think highly of me,
and I am not buying it.

30:03.711 --> 30:05.190
I thought you liked it very much.

30:05.191 --> 30:06.191
Go away.

30:09.911 --> 30:11.751
I need a minute.

30:13.391 --> 30:14.750
Development plan.

30:14.751 --> 30:15.391
Sounds good.

30:15.391 --> 30:16.391
Hello.

30:17.911 --> 30:19.271
Have you arrived?

30:19.511 --> 30:20.511
Where are you?

30:21.551 --> 30:22.311
I see.

30:22.312 --> 30:24.110
Wait for us at the crossroad.

30:24.111 --> 30:25.630
I'm with President Xie at Youfeng Cafe.

30:25.631 --> 30:26.631
We're going to the village.

30:27.591 --> 30:28.831
What do you want to drink?

30:29.871 --> 30:30.470
Nana.

30:30.471 --> 30:31.750
Got iced tea?

30:31.751 --> 30:32.751
Yes.

30:33.031 --> 30:34.111
How many people are there?

30:36.871 --> 30:37.911
Got it. I see.

30:38.711 --> 30:39.711
See you then.

30:44.391 --> 30:45.390
Xie.

30:45.391 --> 30:47.110
Go to find Li,
and draft a contact.

30:47.111 --> 30:47.830
Sure.

30:47.831 --> 30:48.831
President Xu,

30:49.271 --> 30:50.511
please prepare the money.

30:53.471 --> 30:54.630
President Xu.

30:54.631 --> 30:55.790
We have to leave now.

30:55.791 --> 30:56.630
No, problem, see you.

30:56.631 --> 30:56.911
See you.

30:56.912 --> 30:57.750
I'll read the plan later.

30:57.751 --> 30:58.031
Okay.

30:58.031 --> 30:58.391
See you.

30:58.392 --> 30:59.951
Bye. Bye.

31:03.551 --> 31:04.271
Four cups of iced tea.

31:04.272 --> 31:05.390
Thank you.

31:05.391 --> 31:06.071
Bye, Nana.

31:06.071 --> 31:06.471
See you.

31:06.471 --> 31:07.471
Bye.

31:12.631 --> 31:14.390
I am too happy.

31:14.391 --> 31:16.790
Now sweet Hongdou
and beautiful Nana

31:16.791 --> 31:18.271
will take over the guesthouse.

31:18.831 --> 31:19.831
Xie,

31:20.471 --> 31:23.030
you told me to tell
them how difficult it is.

31:23.031 --> 31:25.191
Have you thought that they might give up?

31:25.511 --> 31:28.150
If they just give it up,
it means they're not the ones

31:28.151 --> 31:30.151
to run this guesthouse.

31:32.911 --> 31:35.190
You're afraid they do it impulsively.

31:35.191 --> 31:36.791
Why did you ask me to tell them?

31:37.591 --> 31:40.031
It's not my role to criticize.

31:42.831 --> 31:46.110
You know the risk monitoring of a relationship.

31:46.111 --> 31:47.430
Gross.

31:47.431 --> 31:49.870
If you don't wanna listen, go for her now.

31:49.871 --> 31:51.070
Why are you in a hurry?

31:51.071 --> 31:52.670
There's no need to hurry.

31:52.671 --> 31:53.271
You should be.

31:53.272 --> 31:55.151
If you don't do it now, you're done.

31:55.431 --> 31:57.671
Everything is under my control.

31:59.111 --> 32:01.191
Everything is under your control.

32:10.831 --> 32:13.270
♫ Little crayons ♫

32:13.271 --> 32:15.750
♫ in beautiful labels. ♫

32:15.751 --> 32:20.111
♫ They are red, yellow, blue, and green. ♫

32:20.471 --> 32:23.030
♫ Little friends ♫

32:23.031 --> 32:25.510
♫ in great delight. ♫

32:25.511 --> 32:29.391
♫ They draw pictures to compete. ♫

32:30.271 --> 32:32.830
♫ Someone draws a bird ♫

32:32.831 --> 32:34.670
♫ flying in the blue sky. ♫

32:34.671 --> 32:35.671
Hulu.

32:36.111 --> 32:37.351
Your dad.

32:37.751 --> 32:39.871
♫ Growing up in spring. ♫

32:40.191 --> 32:42.630
♫ You draw the sun. ♫

32:42.631 --> 32:45.190
♫ I draw the national flag. ♫

32:45.191 --> 32:47.830
♫ My country. My country. ♫

32:47.831 --> 32:50.430
♫ We love you. ♫

32:50.431 --> 32:52.670
♫ My country. My country. ♫

32:52.671 --> 32:55.431
♫ We love you. ♫

32:59.951 --> 33:01.671
Do you want to stand at the center?

33:02.831 --> 33:05.071
But I think it's good
to stand at the end.

33:05.591 --> 33:07.830
The center is the best place.

33:07.831 --> 33:10.070
I want the best position.

33:10.071 --> 33:10.870
Like me.

33:10.871 --> 33:12.070
You sing out of tune.

33:12.071 --> 33:13.231
So you may not get it.

33:13.751 --> 33:16.191
I know. I've been working on it.

33:22.191 --> 33:22.711
Dad.

33:22.712 --> 33:25.591
No one bought your water dispenser?

33:27.271 --> 33:28.750
Someone will buy it.

33:28.751 --> 33:30.951
Dad, you should work hard.

33:31.631 --> 33:32.631
I will.

33:39.191 --> 33:40.270
By the way, dad.

33:40.271 --> 33:42.191
I'll tell you a secret.

33:43.431 --> 33:44.710
What is it?

33:44.711 --> 33:46.951
Don't feel sad about it.

33:47.431 --> 33:48.431
I don't.

33:49.511 --> 33:52.551
There is a man,
trying to date my mom.

33:53.511 --> 33:54.511
A man?

33:59.711 --> 34:00.510
Here. Xiaochun.

34:00.511 --> 34:01.511
Check it.

34:04.831 --> 34:05.831
Don't worry.

34:06.151 --> 34:09.111
I selected the products carefully.

34:09.351 --> 34:10.790
I only send the best to you.

34:10.791 --> 34:12.671
Tell me if there's any problem.

34:16.231 --> 34:17.431
Okay, it's not bad.

34:17.911 --> 34:18.911
Unload them.

34:21.031 --> 34:22.031
By the way,

34:22.991 --> 34:24.150
it's for you.

34:24.151 --> 34:26.510
You can use it to make
soup or steep it in water.

34:26.511 --> 34:28.350
I can see how tired you have been recently.

34:28.351 --> 34:29.431
It's good for you.

34:34.791 --> 34:36.151
Caterpillar fungus.

34:36.431 --> 34:37.150
You're welcome.

34:37.151 --> 34:38.030
Treat me to dinner.

34:38.031 --> 34:38.391
No, I can't.

34:38.391 --> 34:39.111
It's too expensive.

34:39.112 --> 34:40.110
I can't afford it.

34:40.111 --> 34:41.190
It's cheap.

34:41.191 --> 34:41.871
Take it.

34:41.872 --> 34:43.030
Thanks for your care.

34:43.031 --> 34:44.231
I'll buy you dinner next time.

34:44.511 --> 34:46.830
Today,
Hulu's dad is back today to see her.

34:46.831 --> 34:47.391
I have to go home.

34:47.391 --> 34:48.471
Aunt Baoping.

34:49.111 --> 34:51.310
Hui is following her everywhere.

34:51.311 --> 34:52.751
Keep it down.

34:54.551 --> 34:56.150
Stop following me.

34:56.151 --> 34:57.870
I will definitely not take it.

34:57.871 --> 35:00.390
I went a thousand miles to get it for you.

35:00.391 --> 35:00.831
Take it.

35:00.831 --> 35:01.351
Take it home.

35:01.352 --> 35:02.270
Give it to your family.

35:02.271 --> 35:04.030
Take it. It's good for your health.

35:04.031 --> 35:04.511
I'll help you.

35:04.511 --> 35:05.511
I'll carry it for you.

35:14.551 --> 35:15.447
Well.

35:15.471 --> 35:16.471
It's time.

35:18.591 --> 35:19.231
I'll set the table.

35:19.232 --> 35:20.190
No, it's fine.

35:20.191 --> 35:20.990
Take a seat.

35:20.991 --> 35:21.910
Hulu. Take a break.

35:21.911 --> 35:22.591
Clear the table.

35:22.592 --> 35:23.470
It's time for dinner.

35:23.471 --> 35:24.630
Dad will help you to do it.

35:24.631 --> 35:25.470
Sure.

35:25.471 --> 35:26.511
Wash your hands.

35:29.951 --> 35:31.271
You must be hungry.

35:31.551 --> 35:32.871
Mom, I am not hungry.

35:33.471 --> 35:34.590
You must be starving.

35:34.591 --> 35:35.710
I know.

35:35.711 --> 35:37.750
The company has new regulations now.

35:37.751 --> 35:38.950
If you don't clock in or out on time,

35:38.951 --> 35:40.671
you can't get the attendance bonus.

35:41.311 --> 35:42.790
You must have been waiting.

35:42.791 --> 35:43.510
It's good.

35:43.511 --> 35:45.231
I can accompany her to practice calligraphy.

35:46.471 --> 35:47.751
Well, take your seat.

35:49.311 --> 35:50.750
What about Xiaxia?

35:50.751 --> 35:51.991
Xiaxia doesn't eat at home.

35:53.271 --> 35:54.271
Here you are.

35:57.471 --> 35:58.190
Thank you, mom.

35:58.191 --> 35:59.311
I need her bowl.

36:01.271 --> 36:04.551
How are the sales of water dispensers recently?

36:05.431 --> 36:06.390
Not bad.

36:06.391 --> 36:07.367
Not bad?

36:07.391 --> 36:08.591
It's good.

36:10.031 --> 36:11.190
How are your parents?

36:11.191 --> 36:12.311
Are they good?

36:12.751 --> 36:13.950
They're good now.

36:13.951 --> 36:14.670
It's great.

36:14.671 --> 36:16.470
You... can't waste
your time here.

36:16.471 --> 36:18.190
It's late after dinner,
so you have to go.

36:18.191 --> 36:19.991
Or it will be dangerous to drive at night.

36:20.351 --> 36:21.351
Okay.

36:23.391 --> 36:25.151
Have you told your parents

36:25.751 --> 36:27.311
that Hulu is about to attend primary school?

36:30.911 --> 36:31.670
I...

36:31.671 --> 36:33.271
It's not urgent.

36:38.431 --> 36:41.071
You can't take it easy to do anything.

36:41.351 --> 36:45.310
Your parents thought Hulu
would go to study in Kunming.

36:45.311 --> 36:46.950
You have to tell them immediately.

36:46.951 --> 36:48.910
You can't postpone everything.

36:48.911 --> 36:50.711
Listen, I hate it most.

36:52.671 --> 36:53.990
Eat.

36:53.991 --> 36:56.151
I know. I'll tell them when I get home.

36:58.311 --> 36:58.911
Eat.

36:58.911 --> 36:59.911
Thank you, mom.

37:01.711 --> 37:03.190
You must tell them, okay?

37:03.191 --> 37:04.711
No problem. Here you are.

37:05.431 --> 37:06.710
Mom, here you are.

37:06.711 --> 37:07.711
I can do it myself.

37:07.871 --> 37:09.110
Don't take care of others.

37:09.111 --> 37:10.151
Eat more meat.

37:22.431 --> 37:23.431
Take it.

37:23.951 --> 37:26.831
This is for you and your parents.

37:28.311 --> 37:30.991
Remember to tell them
that Hulu is studying here.

37:33.231 --> 37:34.231
And...

37:35.311 --> 37:36.551
Do you have enough money?

37:37.311 --> 37:40.511
I know,
we're saving money for her education,

37:40.791 --> 37:43.350
but selling water
dispensers is not a stable job.

37:43.351 --> 37:44.791
If you have trouble, tell me.

37:45.631 --> 37:47.911
I'm eating at home,
so I don't need much money.

37:48.471 --> 37:49.190
I see.

37:49.191 --> 37:50.390
Take care of yourself.

37:50.391 --> 37:53.231
I will not use any money on Hulu's card.

37:53.631 --> 37:54.631
It's time.

37:55.551 --> 37:56.551
Xiaochun.

38:00.591 --> 38:02.871
Say it directly.

38:04.911 --> 38:06.791
Are you in a relationship?

38:10.271 --> 38:10.990
No.

38:10.991 --> 38:12.471
Why do you ask it?

38:12.831 --> 38:14.071
None of your business.

38:14.351 --> 38:17.951
And no matter what I do,
I will take care of our girl well.

38:18.191 --> 38:19.990
I, I didn't mean it.

38:19.991 --> 38:21.590
And, Luo Quan.

38:21.591 --> 38:22.950
I don't care if you date anyone,

38:22.951 --> 38:24.270
but you'd tell your mom everything.

38:24.271 --> 38:26.110
Don't beat around the bushes.

38:26.111 --> 38:28.550
If she feels wronged,
she will call my mom again,

38:28.551 --> 38:29.790
and my mom has to comfort her.

38:29.791 --> 38:32.030
You are a really weird guy.

38:32.031 --> 38:34.270
If anything happens,
why can't you call me directly?

38:34.271 --> 38:35.590
Why do you call my mom?

38:35.591 --> 38:37.550
What are you thinking?

38:37.551 --> 38:39.591
I do want to call you.

38:40.671 --> 38:43.670
But I, I'm afraid you,
you will criticize me.

38:43.671 --> 38:46.031
Have I done that to you?

38:50.391 --> 38:52.350
Fine, Just leave.

38:52.351 --> 38:53.511
Be careful.

38:59.271 --> 39:00.551
I'll come here next month.

39:01.311 --> 39:03.350
You don't have to come here if you are busy.

39:03.351 --> 39:04.031
I will ask Hulu

39:04.032 --> 39:06.271
to go to visit her grandparents
during the holidays.

39:07.231 --> 39:08.231
I'll come next month.

39:09.111 --> 39:10.191
Well, it's up to you.

39:12.031 --> 39:14.710
Xiaochun, could you be patient with me?

39:14.711 --> 39:16.510
Am I not patient with you?

39:16.511 --> 39:18.110
Mr. Bandy-legged.

39:18.111 --> 39:18.671
Listen to it.

39:18.671 --> 39:19.431
You said bad things.

39:19.432 --> 39:20.310
What? Look at yourself.

39:20.311 --> 39:21.310
Isn't it bandy-legged?

39:21.311 --> 39:22.311
I...

39:25.631 --> 39:27.270
Your parents did give you a good name.

39:27.271 --> 39:28.991
It tells what you are.

39:34.671 --> 39:35.231
Well, that's all.

39:35.231 --> 39:36.231
Just go now.

39:36.591 --> 39:37.791
See you.

39:38.031 --> 39:39.231
I will come next month.

39:47.551 --> 39:48.551
Xiaochun.

39:48.911 --> 39:51.191
Can you say everything once and for all?

39:52.871 --> 39:54.350
Take care.

39:54.351 --> 39:55.551
Don't work too hard.

39:58.951 --> 39:59.711
I have to leave now.

39:59.712 --> 40:00.831
Just go.

40:14.111 --> 40:14.751
Look at him.

40:14.752 --> 40:17.031
How could I like him in college?

40:26.351 --> 40:26.911
Come on. Easy.

40:26.912 --> 40:27.750
I'll hold it.

40:27.751 --> 40:28.751
Okay.

40:29.671 --> 40:31.111
Here. Easy.

40:34.111 --> 40:35.830
There's too much mud on them.

40:35.831 --> 40:36.591
Xiaochun.

40:36.592 --> 40:38.791
It's impossible
if there's no mud.

40:39.951 --> 40:40.670
61.

40:40.671 --> 40:41.951
No mud next time.

40:42.831 --> 40:43.271
Of course.

40:43.271 --> 40:43.790
Come on.

40:43.791 --> 40:44.670
One, two, three.

40:44.671 --> 40:45.671
Go.

40:46.431 --> 40:46.911
Anyone?

40:46.912 --> 40:48.151
Yue, push them in.

40:50.671 --> 40:54.111
In my eyes, Hui is a nice boy.

40:54.951 --> 40:57.150
His new house is grand.

40:57.151 --> 40:59.991
As I heard,
he has another house in Xiaguan.

41:00.631 --> 41:01.631
Baoping.

41:02.151 --> 41:04.391
Age is not a problem.

41:04.711 --> 41:06.270
You all said he is a good boy.

41:06.271 --> 41:07.790
But Xiaochun doesn't like him.

41:07.791 --> 41:09.990
Hulu's dad often comes to see her.

41:09.991 --> 41:12.110
Are they back together now?

41:12.111 --> 41:15.751
Luo Quan, he is an oyster.

41:16.151 --> 41:17.871
I felt it a long time ago

41:18.191 --> 41:20.031
that they're not made for each other.

41:20.431 --> 41:21.990
Why do you feel so?

41:21.991 --> 41:23.910
An oyster and a short fuse.

41:23.911 --> 41:27.110
If both of them have a short fuse,
they can't live together.

41:27.111 --> 41:27.950
Right?

41:27.951 --> 41:28.471
You're right.

41:28.472 --> 41:29.951
- Yes.
- It's true.

41:30.311 --> 41:31.311
Good evening.

41:32.911 --> 41:33.950
Hongdou's here.

41:33.951 --> 41:35.231
Aunt Gui is here, too.

41:35.551 --> 41:37.430
I was watching TV at home.

41:37.431 --> 41:38.870
It's better to have fun with them here,

41:38.871 --> 41:40.510
and I can help them at the same time.

41:40.511 --> 41:41.270
It's great.

41:41.271 --> 41:42.430
Why are you here?

41:42.431 --> 41:43.630
We're preparing to hand out potatoes.

41:43.631 --> 41:44.951
It's dirty here.

41:45.631 --> 41:46.990
I come to help.

41:46.991 --> 41:47.431
What?

41:47.432 --> 41:48.951
You think I am a trouble here?

41:50.471 --> 41:52.190
How dare he?

41:52.191 --> 41:53.910
He can't wait to see you.

41:53.911 --> 41:56.110
He is so happy now.

41:56.111 --> 41:58.510
She's coming to help you,
but you make fun of her.

41:58.511 --> 41:59.511
Yes.

41:59.831 --> 42:02.910
Yao and Hongdou,
haven't decided on their relationship.

42:02.911 --> 42:06.031
But you are waiting
for a wedding party.

42:07.911 --> 42:09.751
Well, what can I do?

42:10.751 --> 42:11.831
Here, sit.

42:12.591 --> 42:13.870
Stick the delivery slip.

42:13.871 --> 42:14.871
How to do it?

42:15.351 --> 42:15.911
I'll teach you.

42:15.911 --> 42:16.271
Look.

42:16.272 --> 42:18.110
If it has five kilograms on it,
stick it to a small box.

42:18.111 --> 42:20.151
If it has 10 kilograms on it,
stick to a big box.

42:21.351 --> 42:22.471
I will remove this one.

42:22.911 --> 42:23.911
Okay.

42:24.391 --> 42:26.271
What did you say earlier?

42:26.911 --> 42:30.191
We were talking about Xiaochun.

42:31.151 --> 42:33.630
Hulu's dad keeps coming these days.

42:33.631 --> 42:36.230
The vendor, Hui, also likes her.

42:36.231 --> 42:38.910
But it seems that she
feels nothing to them,

42:38.911 --> 42:40.431
and she doesn't like anyone.

42:41.791 --> 42:43.911
When did Hulu's dad come back?

42:44.431 --> 42:46.150
They've decided before divorce,

42:46.151 --> 42:47.430
he can visit the kid every month.

42:47.431 --> 42:49.471
So,
he has to come here every month.

42:50.671 --> 42:51.830
Why did they get a divorce?

42:51.831 --> 42:52.951
He never came home.

42:54.191 --> 42:55.191
An affair?

42:55.671 --> 42:56.670
No.

42:56.671 --> 42:58.511
He's selling water dispensers.

42:59.111 --> 43:00.990
Nowadays, young people

43:00.991 --> 43:02.790
will get divorced
if they can't stand each other.

43:02.791 --> 43:05.191
You know Bai? Living in another block.

43:05.471 --> 43:07.510
Even her girl is about to go to college.

43:07.511 --> 43:08.830
But she still got divorced.

43:08.831 --> 43:13.430
Listen to me,
I saw Bai hanging out with Hu Youyu.

43:13.431 --> 43:15.271
They are in the bar every day.

43:15.951 --> 43:17.790
Why does she like him?

43:17.791 --> 43:19.150
For what?

43:19.151 --> 43:22.270
But Hu is an artistic musician.

43:22.271 --> 43:24.750
A girl likes a man charming like him.

43:24.751 --> 43:26.510
What kind of charm does he have?

43:26.511 --> 43:28.190
He has a glib tongue.

43:28.191 --> 43:31.271
I think Bai should watch
out or she'll be cheated.

43:32.271 --> 43:33.550
Stop it.

43:33.551 --> 43:34.751
It's not our business.

43:35.631 --> 43:37.710
You have a prejudice against Hu.

43:37.711 --> 43:39.151
But he is a nice person.

43:40.431 --> 43:43.110
The way he looks is a bit annoying.

43:43.111 --> 43:44.670
But actually, he's trustworthy.

43:44.671 --> 43:45.911
He cares about friends.

43:46.231 --> 43:48.550
You can't judge a person
from the appearance.

43:48.551 --> 43:50.311
You should get to know more about him.

43:51.791 --> 43:54.110
Are his parents good now?

43:54.111 --> 43:54.790
They are good.

43:54.791 --> 43:56.350
And his grandparents are good.

43:56.351 --> 43:59.831
So if he cares about people so much,
why doesn't he go home?

44:02.191 --> 44:06.191
You... can't judge a
person from the appearance.

44:06.551 --> 44:08.071
Right? Baoping?

44:16.431 --> 44:17.431
Mr. Hu.

44:22.391 --> 44:23.110
Okay.

44:23.111 --> 44:23.791
I'll be there soon.

44:23.791 --> 44:24.791
Wait for a moment.

44:25.231 --> 44:26.231
What's going on?

44:26.551 --> 44:28.030
I have to go to the bar.

44:28.031 --> 44:29.471
Hu was stopped by someone.

44:30.751 --> 44:31.791
I'm going with you.

44:32.191 --> 44:33.191
Okay. Go.

44:35.031 --> 44:36.231
Stop? What did he mean?

44:38.551 --> 44:44.031
♫ Listen to the rain
falling into the silent forest ♫

44:45.991 --> 44:50.951
♫ Enjoy the mountainous landscape at sunset ♫

44:53.391 --> 44:59.471
♫ The raindrops on the roof
fall into the eyes secretly ♫

44:59.791 --> 45:05.151
♫ The world is like a quiet island ♫

45:08.111 --> 45:13.511
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

45:15.471 --> 45:20.351
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

45:22.911 --> 45:29.111
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

45:29.431 --> 45:35.631
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

45:37.711 --> 45:44.150
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

45:44.151 --> 45:50.911
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

45:52.311 --> 45:54.350
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

45:54.351 --> 45:58.751
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

45:58.991 --> 46:06.191
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

46:10.991 --> 46:16.151
♫ The sky is turning bright silently ♫

46:18.311 --> 46:23.671
♫ Waiting for the seabirds
to call forth the ripples ♫

46:25.711 --> 46:32.110
♫ Waiting for the sunlight to shine into
my heart across the lake ♫

46:32.111 --> 46:39.031
♫ Set sail when it's windy ♫

46:40.471 --> 46:46.711
♫ The reflection of clouds, the changing moon
and the stars all over the sky ♫

46:46.951 --> 46:53.871
♫ The lost footsteps will be gradually erased ♫

46:55.151 --> 46:57.110
♫ The light and shadow of four seasons ♫

46:57.111 --> 47:01.710
♫ I've seen the meteor
that lights up the night sky ♫

47:01.711 --> 47:08.711
♫ When the wind rises,
the sky will be cloudless ♫

47:09.071 --> 47:16.031
♫ Go to a windy place to meet you ♫
